      "answer_index": 0,
      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\\text{(1)必要性：当}\\rho_{XY}=\\pm 1\\text{时}&amp;D\\left(\\frac{Y}{\\sqrt{D(Y)}}\\mp \\frac{X}{\\sqrt{D(X)}}\\right)=D\\left(\\frac{Y}{\\sqrt{D(Y)}}\\right)+D\\left(\\frac{X}{\\sqrt{D(X)}}\\right)\\mp 2\\mathrm{cov}\\left(\\frac{Y}{\\sqrt{D(Y)}},\\frac{X}{\\sqrt{D(X)}}\\right)\\\\&amp;=1+1\\mp 2\\cdot \\frac{\\mathrm{cov}(X,Y)}{\\sqrt{D(Y)}\\sqrt{D(X)}}=2\\mp 2\\rho_{XY}=0\\,.\\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned}\\text{(1)必要性：当}\\rho_{XY}=\\pm 1\\text{时}&amp;D\\left(\\frac{Y}{\\sqrt{D(Y)}}\\mp \\frac{X}{\\sqrt{D(X)}}\\right)=D\\left(\\frac{Y}{\\sqrt{D(Y)}}\\right)+D\\left(\\frac{X}{\\sqrt{D(X)}}\\right)\\mp 2\\mathrm{cov}\\left(\\frac{Y}{\\sqrt{D(Y)}},\\frac{X}{\\sqrt{D(X)}}\\right)\\\\&amp;=1+1\\mp 2\\cdot \\frac{\\mathrm{cov}(X,Y)}{\\sqrt{D(Y)}\\sqrt{D(X)}}=2\\mp 2\\rho_{XY}=0\\,.\\end{aligned}</div>\n<span class=\"math-tex math-inline\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"\\text{由方差的性质可知}：\\text{存在常数} C \\text{使} P\\left\\{\\frac{Y}{\\sqrt{D(Y)}}\\mp \\frac{X}{\\sqrt{D(X)}}=C\\right\\}=1，\\text{即} P\\left\\{Y=\\pm \\sqrt{\\frac{D(Y)}{D(X)}}X+C\\sqrt{D(Y)}\\right\\}=1．\">\\text{由方差的性质可知}：\\text{存在常数} C \\text{使} P\\left\\{\\frac{Y}{\\sqrt{D(Y)}}\\mp \\frac{X}{\\sqrt{D(X)}}=C\\right\\}=1，\\text{即} P\\left\\{Y=\\pm \\sqrt{\\frac{D(Y)}{D(X)}}X+C\\sqrt{D(Y)}\\right\\}=1．</span>\n<span class=\"math-tex math-inline\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"\\text{令} a=\\pm \\sqrt{\\frac{D(Y)}{D(X)}}，b=C\\sqrt{D(Y)}，\\text{则有} P\\{Y=aX+b\\}=1\\,(a\\neq 0)．\">\\text{令} a=\\pm \\sqrt{\\frac{D(Y)}{D(X)}}，b=C\\sqrt{D(Y)}，\\text{则有} P\\{Y=aX+b\\}=1\\,(a\\neq 0)．</span>\n<span class=\"math-tex math-inline\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"\\text{当} \\rho_{XY}=1 \\text{时}，a=\\sqrt{\\frac{D(Y)}{D(X)}}&gt;0；\\text{当} \\rho_{XY}=-1 \\text{时}，a=-\\sqrt{\\frac{D(Y)}{D(X)}}&lt;0．\">\\text{当} \\rho_{XY}=1 \\text{时}，a=\\sqrt{\\frac{D(Y)}{D(X)}}&gt;0；\\text{当} \\rho_{XY}=-1 \\text{时}，a=-\\sqrt{\\frac{D(Y)}{D(X)}}&lt;0．</span>\n<span class=\"math-tex math-inline\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"(2)\\text{充分性}：\\text{若} P\\{Y=aX+b\\}=1\\,(a\\neq 0)，\\text{于是}：\">(2)\\text{充分性}：\\text{若} P\\{Y=aX+b\\}=1\\,(a\\neq 0)，\\text{于是}：</span>\n<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\rho=\\frac{\\mathrm{cov}(X,aX+b)}{\\sqrt{D(X)}\\sqrt{D(aX+b)}}=\\frac{acov(X,Y)}{\\sqrt{D(X)}\\sqrt{a^2D(X)}}=\\frac{aD(X)}{\\sqrt{a^2}\\cdot D(X)}=\\begin{cases}1,&amp;a&gt;0\\\\-1,&amp;a&lt;0\\end{cases}.\">\\rho=\\frac{\\mathrm{cov}(X,aX+b)}{\\sqrt{D(X)}\\sqrt{D(aX+b)}}=\\frac{acov(X,Y)}{\\sqrt{D(X)}\\sqrt{a^2D(X)}}=\\frac{aD(X)}{\\sqrt{a^2}\\cdot D(X)}=\\begin{cases}1,&amp;a&gt;0\\\\-1,&amp;a&lt;0\\end{cases}.</div>"
