      "answer": "A",
      "answer_index": 0,
      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\text{由相关系数的定义知}\\rho(\\xi,\\eta)=\\frac{\\operatorname{cov}(\\xi,\\eta)}{\\sqrt{D(\\xi)D(\\eta)}}\\,.\\,\\,\\text{若令}b=\\frac{\\operatorname{cov}(\\xi,\\eta)}{D(\\xi)},\\,\\,\\text{则}\\\\&amp;D(\\eta-b\\xi)=b^2D(\\xi)+D(\\eta)-2bc\\operatorname{cov}(\\xi,\\eta)=D(\\eta)[1-\\rho^2(\\xi,\\eta)],\\\\&amp;\\text{由于方差}D(\\eta)&gt;0,\\,\\,D(\\eta-b\\xi)\\geq 0,\\,\\,\\text{故必有}1-\\rho^2(\\xi,\\eta)\\geq 0\\,.\\,\\,\\text{即}\\,\\,|\\rho(\\xi,\\eta)|\\leq 1\\,.\\quad \\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\text{由相关系数的定义知}\\rho(\\xi,\\eta)=\\frac{\\operatorname{cov}(\\xi,\\eta)}{\\sqrt{D(\\xi)D(\\eta)}}\\,.\\,\\,\\text{若令}b=\\frac{\\operatorname{cov}(\\xi,\\eta)}{D(\\xi)},\\,\\,\\text{则}\\\\&amp;D(\\eta-b\\xi)=b^2D(\\xi)+D(\\eta)-2bc\\operatorname{cov}(\\xi,\\eta)=D(\\eta)[1-\\rho^2(\\xi,\\eta)],\\\\&amp;\\text{由于方差}D(\\eta)&gt;0,\\,\\,D(\\eta-b\\xi)\\geq 0,\\,\\,\\text{故必有}1-\\rho^2(\\xi,\\eta)\\geq 0\\,.\\,\\,\\text{即}\\,\\,|\\rho(\\xi,\\eta)|\\leq 1\\,.\\quad \\end{aligned}</div>"
