      "answer_index": 0,
      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\text{对随机变量}X,Y,\\text{若取实数}b=\\frac{\\operatorname{cov}(X,Y)}{D(X)}\\ ,\\text{则}\\\\&amp;D(Y-bX)=D(Y)-\\frac{[\\operatorname{cov}(X,Y)]^2}{D(X)}=D(Y)\\left[1-\\frac{[\\operatorname{cov}(X,Y)]^2}{D(X)D(Y)}\\right]=D(Y)[1-\\rho^2]\\ ,\\\\&amp;\\text{由于方差}D(Y)\\text{是正的，故必有}1-\\rho^2\\geq 0\\ ,\\text{所以}|\\rho|\\leq 1.\\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\text{对随机变量}X,Y,\\text{若取实数}b=\\frac{\\operatorname{cov}(X,Y)}{D(X)}\\ ,\\text{则}\\\\&amp;D(Y-bX)=D(Y)-\\frac{[\\operatorname{cov}(X,Y)]^2}{D(X)}=D(Y)\\left[1-\\frac{[\\operatorname{cov}(X,Y)]^2}{D(X)D(Y)}\\right]=D(Y)[1-\\rho^2]\\ ,\\\\&amp;\\text{由于方差}D(Y)\\text{是正的，故必有}1-\\rho^2\\geq 0\\ ,\\text{所以}|\\rho|\\leq 1.\\end{aligned}</div>"
