      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}(X_1,X_2) \\text{的联合分布为}\\\\P\\{X_1=0,X_2=0\\}&amp;=P\\{X_3=1\\}=0.1,\\ \\ P\\{X_1=0,X_2=1\\}=P\\{X_2=1\\}=0.1,\\\\P\\{X_1=1,X_2=0\\}&amp;=P\\{X_1=1\\}=0.8,\\ \\ P\\{X_1=1,X_2=1\\}=P(\\varnothing)=0.\\end{aligned} \\text{关于} X_1 \\text{和} X_2 \\text{的边缘分布律分别为}\\\\P\\{X_1=1\\}=0.8,\\ \\ P\\{X_1=0\\}=0.2,\\ \\ P\\{X_2=1\\}=0.1,\\ \\ P\\{X_2=0\\}=0.9. \\text{于是} E(X_1)=0.8,\\ D(X_1)=0.16;\\ E(X_2)=0.1,\\ D(X_2)=0.09，\\text{从而}\\\\ \n\\rho_{x,x_2}=\\frac{\\operatorname{cov}(X_1,X_2)}{\\sqrt{D(X_1)}\\sqrt{D(X_2)}}=\\frac{E(X_1X_2)-E(X_1)E(X_2)}{\\sqrt{D(X_1)}\\sqrt{D(X_2)}}=\\frac{1\\times 0+0\\times 0.8+0\\times 0.1+0\\times 0.1-0.08}{0.4\\times 0.3}=-\\frac{2}{3}.\">\\begin{aligned}(X_1,X_2) \\text{的联合分布为}\\\\P\\{X_1=0,X_2=0\\}&amp;=P\\{X_3=1\\}=0.1,\\ \\ P\\{X_1=0,X_2=1\\}=P\\{X_2=1\\}=0.1,\\\\P\\{X_1=1,X_2=0\\}&amp;=P\\{X_1=1\\}=0.8,\\ \\ P\\{X_1=1,X_2=1\\}=P(\\varnothing)=0.\\end{aligned} \\text{关于} X_1 \\text{和} X_2 \\text{的边缘分布律分别为}\\\\P\\{X_1=1\\}=0.8,\\ \\ P\\{X_1=0\\}=0.2,\\ \\ P\\{X_2=1\\}=0.1,\\ \\ P\\{X_2=0\\}=0.9. \\text{于是} E(X_1)=0.8,\\ D(X_1)=0.16;\\ E(X_2)=0.1,\\ D(X_2)=0.09，\\text{从而}\\\\ \n\\rho_{x,x_2}=\\frac{\\operatorname{cov}(X_1,X_2)}{\\sqrt{D(X_1)}\\sqrt{D(X_2)}}=\\frac{E(X_1X_2)-E(X_1)E(X_2)}{\\sqrt{D(X_1)}\\sqrt{D(X_2)}}=\\frac{1\\times 0+0\\times 0.8+0\\times 0.1+0\\times 0.1-0.08}{0.4\\times 0.3}=-\\frac{2}{3}.</div>"
