      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned} \\text{由}\\lambda\\text{服从二项分布}B(4,0.8),\\text{有}E(X)=4\\times 0.8=3.2,\\ D(X)=4\\times 0.8\\times 0.2=0.64.\\ \\text{由}\\gamma\\text{服从泊松分布}P(4),\\ \\text{有}E(Y)=4,\\ D(Y)=4.\\ \\ \\text{从而} \\\\ D(X+Y)=D(X)+D(Y)+2\\text{cov}(X,Y)=D(X)+D(Y)+2\\sqrt{D(X)}\\sqrt{D(Y)}\\rho_{XY},\\\\ \\\\ 3.6=0.64+4+2\\sqrt{0.64}\\sqrt{4}\\rho_{XY}.\\\\ \\text{于是，} \\\\ \\rho_{XY}=\\frac{3.6-4.64}{2\\times 0.8\\times 2}=\\frac{-1.04}{3.2}=\\frac{-13}{40}.\\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned} \\text{由}\\lambda\\text{服从二项分布}B(4,0.8),\\text{有}E(X)=4\\times 0.8=3.2,\\ D(X)=4\\times 0.8\\times 0.2=0.64.\\ \\text{由}\\gamma\\text{服从泊松分布}P(4),\\ \\text{有}E(Y)=4,\\ D(Y)=4.\\ \\ \\text{从而} \\\\ D(X+Y)=D(X)+D(Y)+2\\text{cov}(X,Y)=D(X)+D(Y)+2\\sqrt{D(X)}\\sqrt{D(Y)}\\rho_{XY},\\\\ \\\\ 3.6=0.64+4+2\\sqrt{0.64}\\sqrt{4}\\rho_{XY}.\\\\ \\text{于是，} \\\\ \\rho_{XY}=\\frac{3.6-4.64}{2\\times 0.8\\times 2}=\\frac{-1.04}{3.2}=\\frac{-13}{40}.\\end{aligned}</div>"
