      "answer_index": 0,
      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned} \\text{由对称性知，} \\quad&amp; E(Y)=E(X)=\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty}\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty}x f(x,y)\\,dydx=\\int_{0}^{2}\\int_{0}^{2}x\\cdot\\frac{1}{8}(x+y)\\,dydx=\\frac{7}{6},\\\\ &amp;E(Y^2)=E(X^2)=\\int_{0}^{2}\\int_{0}^{2}x^2\\cdot\\frac{1}{8}(x+y)\\,dydx=\\frac{1}{4}\\int_{0}^{2}(x^3+x^2)\\,dx=\\frac{5}{3},\\\\ &amp;D(Y)=D(X)=E(X^2)-[E(X)]^2=\\frac{5}{3}-\\left(-\\frac{7}{6}\\right)^2=\\frac{11}{36}.\\\\ \\text{而} \\quad&amp; E(XY)=\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty}\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty}xyf(x,y)\\,dx dy=\\int_{0}^{2}\\int_{0}^{2}xy\\cdot\\frac{1}{8}(x+y)\\,dx dy=\\int_{0}^{2}\\frac{1}{8}\\left(\\frac{8}{3}y+2y^2\\right)dy=\\frac{4}{3},\\\\ &amp;\\operatorname{cov}(X,\\,Y)=E(XY)-E(X)E(Y)=\\frac{4}{3}-\\frac{7}{6}\\times\\frac{7}{6}=-\\frac{1}{36},\\\\ &amp;\\rho_{XY}=\\frac{\\operatorname{cov}(X,\\,Y)}{\\sqrt{D(X)D(Y)}}=-\\frac{-\\frac{1}{36}}{\\frac{11}{36}}=-\\frac{1}{11},\\\\ &amp;D(X+Y)=D(X)+D(Y)+2\\operatorname{cov}(X,\\,Y)=\\frac{11}{36}+\\frac{11}{36}-2\\times\\frac{1}{36}=\\frac{5}{9}.\\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned} \\text{由对称性知，} \\quad&amp; E(Y)=E(X)=\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty}\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty}x f(x,y)\\,dydx=\\int_{0}^{2}\\int_{0}^{2}x\\cdot\\frac{1}{8}(x+y)\\,dydx=\\frac{7}{6},\\\\ &amp;E(Y^2)=E(X^2)=\\int_{0}^{2}\\int_{0}^{2}x^2\\cdot\\frac{1}{8}(x+y)\\,dydx=\\frac{1}{4}\\int_{0}^{2}(x^3+x^2)\\,dx=\\frac{5}{3},\\\\ &amp;D(Y)=D(X)=E(X^2)-[E(X)]^2=\\frac{5}{3}-\\left(-\\frac{7}{6}\\right)^2=\\frac{11}{36}.\\\\ \\text{而} \\quad&amp; E(XY)=\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty}\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty}xyf(x,y)\\,dx dy=\\int_{0}^{2}\\int_{0}^{2}xy\\cdot\\frac{1}{8}(x+y)\\,dx dy=\\int_{0}^{2}\\frac{1}{8}\\left(\\frac{8}{3}y+2y^2\\right)dy=\\frac{4}{3},\\\\ &amp;\\operatorname{cov}(X,\\,Y)=E(XY)-E(X)E(Y)=\\frac{4}{3}-\\frac{7}{6}\\times\\frac{7}{6}=-\\frac{1}{36},\\\\ &amp;\\rho_{XY}=\\frac{\\operatorname{cov}(X,\\,Y)}{\\sqrt{D(X)D(Y)}}=-\\frac{-\\frac{1}{36}}{\\frac{11}{36}}=-\\frac{1}{11},\\\\ &amp;D(X+Y)=D(X)+D(Y)+2\\operatorname{cov}(X,\\,Y)=\\frac{11}{36}+\\frac{11}{36}-2\\times\\frac{1}{36}=\\frac{5}{9}.\\end{aligned}</div>"
